{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26093","headline":"和淮南李相公夷简喜平淄青回军之作 · 鲍溶","name":"和淮南李相公夷简喜平淄青回军之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"横笛临吹发晓军，元戎幢节拂寒云。\n搜山羽骑乘风引，下濑楼船背水分。\n天际兽旗摇火焰，日前鱼甲动金文。\n马毛不汗东方靖，行见萧何第一勳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}